                <mxCell id="notes" value="Huidige opzet:&lt;br&gt;- API en BackgroundService draaien in één container.&lt;br&gt;- OpenMRS publiceert events asynchroon via RabbitMQ.&lt;br&gt;- Vier provider adapters (IMessageProvider):&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AsyncFlow, LegacyLink, SecurePost, SwiftSend.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ADR-koppeling:&lt;br&gt;- ADR1: module staat los van OpenMRS.&lt;br&gt;- ADR2: C#/.NET, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Grafana.&lt;br&gt;- ADR3: event-driven integratie via RabbitMQ.&lt;br&gt;- ADR4: RabbitMQ als gekozen queue-infrastructuur." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;fontColor=#374151;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
